The Apple Watch Series 12 brings a more substantial set of changes than the Series 11, which was one of the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-watch-series-10-vs-series-11/">smallest refreshes</a> in the device's history. While Apple has discontinued previous Series models, older watches may still be available at lower prices from third-party retailers or secondhand.<br/>
